+// cfx assembly alias tables (ADR-0017 D3/D4/D8; Toolchain-01 §13).
+// MECHANICALLY GENERATED from spec/DADAO-12/13 register tables through the
+// committed projector tools/spec/gen_cfx_aliases.py (the same source that
+// produces the drift-gated .tao/knowledge/contract-cfx-aliases.md).
+// Generator: tools/llvm/gen_cfx_alias_table.py
+//
+//   cfx_<cfxname>           <=> cfx<code>            (13 scalar aliases)
+//   cfx_<cfxname>_<tail>    ->  (cfxha, cg, rc)      (66 generic tails)
+//   cfx_<cfxname>_<regname> ->  (cfxha, cg, rc)      (34 cfx-specific)
+//
+// Array registers (ADR-0017 D10) have RcCount > 1 and are addressed by the
+// single-subscript form cfx_<...>[N] (rc = RcBase + N, 0 <= N < RcCount).
+//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
+
